      "src/components/app/AppShell.tsx (theme application logic)",
      "src/styles/formTheme.css (the bridge layer itself)"
    ],
    "is_simple_rename_possible": false,
    "reasoning": "The --bd-* system is NOT a simple rename of shadcn vars. It is a BRIDGE LAYER that: (1) maps to shadcn vars by default, (2) gets overridden by 26+ named theme presets at runtime via JS, (3) includes tokens that have NO shadcn equivalent (spacing, typography, radius, status colors, overlay tokens, icon tokens). The --bd-* layer IS the theme system — removing it would break all named theme presets. Migration would require either: (A) keeping the bridge but using Tailwind utility classes that reference the same vars (e.g., bg-bd-button-primary-bg instead of bg-[hsl(var(--bd-button-primary-bg))]), or (B) a complete redesign of the theme preset system to use CSS layers or Tailwind's built-in theming."
  }
